msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:130
msgid "Last page shown, for the development build's own library"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:131
msgid "As last-page, for the development build."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:135
msgid "Expanded playlist folders, for the development build's own library"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:136
msgid "As expanded-folders, for the development build."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:141
msgid "Hours between automatic library syncs"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:142
msgid ""
"While the app runs, the library is synced again whenever the last sync is "
"older than this many hours and the engine is running and signed in (it is "
"not started for a sync). 0 syncs only when asked (Refresh Library). A "
"library missing or damaged on disk is synced as soon as the engine is up, "
"whatever this says."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:146
msgid "Sort order of each grid page"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:147
msgid ""
"The order last chosen in a grid page's Sort By menu (title, artist, year or "
"added), by page: albums, music-videos, or library-artist (an artist's albums "
"in the library: year or title)."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:151
msgid "Library pages showing favourites only"
msgstr "Library pages showing favorites only"

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:152
msgid ""
"The pages (albums, music-videos, songs) last left with Favourites Only "
"chosen in their Sort and Filter menu."
msgstr ""
"The pages (albums, music-videos, songs) last left with Favorites Only chosen "
"in their Sort and Filter menu."

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:156
msgid "Show Genres in the sidebar"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:157
msgid ""
"Whether the sidebar's Library section lists Genres: the library's albums by "
"genre."
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:161
msgid "Optional columns of the song tables"
msgstr ""

#: data/io.github.jackicus.MusicSleeve.gschema.xml:162
msgid ""
"The optional columns (genre, year) the Songs table and a playlist's table "
"show, as last chosen in their menus. Narrow windows leave them out."
msgstr ""

